  "story": "Steppe orcs became a way of life among the orcs ~9 kyr ago at the edge of its people's land, on the continent at 6\u00b0N 31\u00b0W (7.4 Mkm\u00b2). Today: about 24,000 in 0.09 Mkm\u00b2 in one land; neighbours human farmers, humans, halflings, half-orcs. It took up dogs (~5.3 kyr ago), sheep and goats (~1.8 kyr ago) and cattle (~1.5 kyr ago). Its milk-drinking 10% keep dairy herds of cattle and sheep and goats. The steppe orcs 10% digest milk as adults, have a keen sense of smell, and eat raw meat safely. It cooks over dung fires.",
